---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About GamesBrowse"
  description="Learn how GamesBrowse is evolving from a single-page launch into a multi-page browser game platform."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="panel legal-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
        <h1>About GamesBrowse</h1>
        <p class="muted">
          GamesBrowse started as a small single-page browser game launch and is now being reworked
          into a broader game site with dedicated routes, stronger metadata, and future support for
          both native and iframe-based games.
        </p>
        <p class="muted">
          The current migration focuses on structure first: reusable layouts, scalable page
          generation, category routes, and clear rules for external embeds.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

